  "dialog.about.body": {
    "source": "Explore stitch order, thread colors, jumps, trims, and machine commands before production. Preview the design stitch by stitch, switch rendering styles, and export what you see.",
    "translation": "Déan iniúchadh ar ord na ngreama, dathanna snáithe, léimeanna, gearrthacha, agus orduithe meaisín roimh tháirgeadh. Réamhamharc an dearadh greama ar ghreama, athraigh stíleanna rindreála, agus easportáil an rud a fheiceann tú."
  },
